{
  "title": "Namaz for Solving Difficulties",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Imam al-Sadiq (a) is reported to have said: when you face a difficulty, you may offer a two-unit prayer at midday (zuhr). In the first unit, recite [Surah al-Fatihah](A5), [Surah al-Tawheed](A116), and the first three verses of [Surah al-Fath](A52) (no. 48). In the second unit, recite Surah al-Fatihah, Surah al-Tawheed, and [Surah al-Inshirah](A98) (al-Sharh, no. 94).\nThis prayer has been personally experienced [to be effective]."
}
